    "title": "New waterline on the way to Sturgis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ian Young ,\n2 hours ago\nSTURGIS, Ky. (WEHT) — Sturgis may soon be getting a replacement for some of their old waterlines.\nThe town’s two oldest waterlines that saw many leaks among other issues are on their way out. The mayor says many within the town are looking forward to seeing this project completed.\nHe estimates the project will be getting under way in the next couple months. Adams also says he hopes the new waterlines are completed by year’s end.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
